contentMarkdown:
This wrapped style minimalist card holder is made to hold 4 to 6 cards in the central pocket, bills and tickets in the two side flap pockets.

The leathers offered on this model are vegetable tanned and eco-responsible.  They will take on a beautiful patina over time which makes them more authentic.

I saved the very first model for my personal use, and this one is still very pleasant to use.  I slip in it between 4 and 6 cards (payment, loyalty, travel), and a few tickets and bills right into my pockets.  Really convenient.

The price is for one wallet only, the picture with the 3 is only to give you different colour combos.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

## Making-of

You’ll find a making-of video, as well as a PDF pattern in the video description.

[Video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eI7caoEwk_0)

